    "section_text": "Minor Curriculum in Petroleum Engineering The petroleum industry employs not only petroleum but also civil, electrical, chemical, geological, mechanical and other engineers. A petroleum engineering minor, therefore, enhances the academic credentials of a student and broadens their employment choices. A minor in petroleum engineering requires 15 hours of Missouri S&T credit to include the following: PET ENG 3520 Petroleum Reservoir Engineering 3 PET ENG 4210 Drilling and Well Integrity 3 PET ENG 4410 Production Engineering 3 Two elective courses* 6 Total Credits 15 *The two elective courses are to be chosen from any petroleum engineering course and/or Petroleum Geology ( GEOLOGY 5513 ) .",
    "section_html": "<div class=\"tab_content\" id=\"minorstextcontainer\">\n<a name=\"minorstext\"></a><h2>Minor Curriculum in Petroleum Engineering</h2> <p>The petroleum industry employs not only petroleum but also civil, electrical, chemical, geological, mechanical and other engineers. A petroleum engineering minor, therefore, enhances the academic credentials of a student and broadens their employment choices. A minor in petroleum engineering requires 15 hours of Missouri S&amp;T credit to include the following:</p> <table class=\"sc_courselist\" width=\"100%\"><colgroup><col class=\"codecol\"/><col class=\"titlecol\"/><col align=\"char\" char=\".\" class=\"hourscol\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr class=\"even firstrow\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=PET%20ENG%203520\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'PET ENG 3520');\" title=\"PET ENG 3520\">PET ENG 3520</a></td><td>Petroleum Reservoir Engineering</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=PET%20ENG%204210\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'PET ENG 4210');\" title=\"PET ENG 4210\">PET ENG 4210</a></td><td>Drilling and Well Integrity</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"even\"><td class=\"codecol\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=PET%20ENG%204410\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'PET ENG 4410');\" title=\"PET ENG 4410\">PET ENG 4410</a></td><td>Production Engineering</td><td class=\"hourscol\">3</td></tr> <tr class=\"odd lastrow\"><td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"courselistcomment\">Two elective courses*</span></td><td class=\"hourscol\">6</td></tr> <tr class=\"listsum\"><td colspan=\"2\">Total Credits</td><td class=\"hourscol\">15</td></tr></tbody></table> <p>*The two elective courses are to be chosen from any petroleum engineering course and/or <span class=\"sc_courseinline\">Petroleum Geology (<a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=GEOLOGY%205513\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'GEOLOGY 5513');\" title=\"GEOLOGY 5513\">GEOLOGY 5513</a>)</span> .</p>\n</div>"
